# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
ZaSlon helper — runs on managed RED OS hosts as root (via sudo from user sec_fw-admin).

  zaslon-helper version
  zaslon-helper collect [--peer IP]          -> JSON: firewalld, iptables, nftables, listening, SELinux, fail2ban, sshd
  zaslon-helper nft-table FAMILY NAME        -> JSON: text of one nftables table
  zaslon-helper avc [--since today|recent|boot] -> JSON: SELinux denials
  zaslon-helper apply [--peer IP]            -> stdin JSON {"ops":[...], "rollback":60, "note":"..."}
  zaslon-helper confirm ID | rollback ID | pending | history

Every change records its exact inverse. With "rollback" > 0 a systemd timer reverts the transaction
unless "confirm" arrives in time — protection against locking yourself out.
All commands are executed without a shell; every argument is validated.
"""
